ype":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-02T17:08:57Z","updated_at":"2026-01-02T17:08:57Z","body":"As side solution I have a project that will allow you to enable installed plugins in other local directories and also track plugins from one place: https://github.com/kaldown/ccpm","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/3705816450/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/3719778116","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/14815#issuecomment-3719778116","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/14815","id":3719778116,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY87dt09E","user":{"login":"dkarmon","id":669552,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2OTU1Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/669552?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarmon","html_url":"https://github.com/dkarmon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarmon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarmon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarmon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarmon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarmon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarmon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarmon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarmon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarmon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T16:46:59Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T16:46:59Z","body":"Running to the same issue with superpowers@superpowers-marketplace and dev-browser@sawyerhood/dev-browser (they suddenly disappeared from the plugin installed view - although cc says they are installed). In some cases plugin appear in the marketplace view but installation is not working.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/3719778116/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/3734634389","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/14815#issuecomment-3734634389","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/14815","id":3734634389,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY87emf-V","user":{"login":"yzavyas","id":111552463,"node_id":"U_kgDOBqYnzw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111552463?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas","html_url":"https://github.com/yzavyas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T14:24:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T14:36:25Z","body":"Experiencing similar issues with custom marketplace plugins. Can confirm the state file disconnect - `installed_plugins.json` shows the plugin but the system doesn't load it.\n\n**Workaround we're trying:** Use a prompt-based SessionStart hook that tells Claude where to find plugins directly.\n\nWe're building [claude-1337](https://github.com/yzavyas/claude-1337) - a plugin marketplace that attempts to sidestep this issue using a SessionStart hook:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"hooks\": {\n    \"SessionStart\": [\n      {\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"prompt\",\n            \"prompt\": \"To find available plugins:\\n1. Read `~/.claude/plugins/known_marketplaces.json` → get `installLocation`\\n2. Read `{installLocation}/.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`\\n3. Plugin content at `{installLocation}/plugins/<name>/`\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe idea is to bypass the loader entirely - Claude reads the marketplace files directly at session start instead of relying on the plugin system to recognize what's installed. Will share updates on how well this works.\n\n**Root cause hypothesis:** The plugin loader and state file have different definitions of \"installed\". State file records intent, loader checks something else (timestamps? git SHAs? version comparisons?) that gets out of sync.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/3734634389/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/3734746074","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/14815#issuecomment-3734746074","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/14815","id":3734746074,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY87em7Pa","user":{"login":"yzavyas","id":111552463,"node_id":"U_kgDOBqYnzw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111552463?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas","html_url":"https://github.com/yzavyas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzavyas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T15:07:11Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T15:07:11Z","body":"**Update:** `type: prompt` hooks don't fire. Switched to `type: command` with a shell script that echoes the prompt content — that works.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"hooks\": {\n    \"SessionStart\": [\n      {\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"command\",\n            \"command\": \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/session-start.sh\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\nWhere `session-start.sh` just echoes the instructions:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\ncat << 'PROMPT'\nTo find available plugins:\n1. Read ~/.claude/plugins/known_marketplaces.json\n2. Read {installLocation}/.claude-plugin/marketplace.json\n3. Plugin content at {installLocation}/plugins/<name>/\nPROMPT\n```\n\nSo there may be two separate bugs here:\n1. Plugin loader not recognizing installed plugins (this issue)\n2. `type: prompt` hooks not firing (possibly related?)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/3734746074/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/373486411